B.amS=new A.az(B.e3,["How does the AI estimation work?","Simply upload 3\u20134 photos of the damaged area from different angles. Our Vision AI analyses the depth and span of the damage and provides an estimated repair cost and time within seconds."],t.w)
B.amT=new A.az(B.e3,["Can I choose which partner workshop handles my repair?","Yes. After receiving the AI estimate, you will see a list of certified partner workshops in your area. You can select one based on ratings, distance, and availability."],t.w)
B.amQ=new A.az(B.e3,["Is the repair quality guaranteed?","Not by re-V. There is no warranty programme yet \u2014 the final price and the terms come from the partner workshop on the invoice, and any guarantee is whatever that workshop offers on its own invoice. What re-V does control is the process: an AI estimate first, a final price after the physical inspection, and progress photos of the work."],t.w)
B.amX=new A.az(B.e3,["How do I track my repair progress?",'Open the "Digital Garage" section of your profile. The Live Tracker shows the current stage \u2014 from intake, through active bodywork and painting, to handover. Each stage is photo-documented.'],t.w)
B.amW=new A.az(B.e3,["Is there a Revive paint guarantee?","No. There is no re-V guarantee certificate today, and none is issued after handover. If a partner workshop offers a guarantee for its own work, it is written on that workshop's invoice."],t.w)
B.amP=new A.az(B.e3,["How are insurance claims handled?","They are not handled automatically yet. There is no Garda Oto or Astra integration, and no insurance document is submitted on your behalf \u2014 please contact the workshop or your insurer directly."],t.w)
